# Wave W17-O (Route 115): mist pine — a spray-fresh shore pine in bright greens, tiered and clean-limbed, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on mist turf (ground baked in). Route 115’s own tree — the freshest pine in the tranche, split from Route 114’s dusty impactpine by moisture and light: shore air, not crater dust.
